  "description": {
    "en": "Babolat Xplore is a comfortable and forgiving polyamide multifilament designed for junior, intermediate and recreational players. Its flexible polyamide filaments absorb vibration effectively and create a lively trampoline effect for easy power, while maintaining enough control for developing players. Made in France using a solvent-free process, Xplore is particularly well suited to players who value comfort, forgiveness and effortless playability.",

    "zh": "Babolat Xplore 是一款强调舒适、易打和容错性的聚酰胺多芯球线，主要面向青少年、中级及休闲球员。柔软的聚酰胺纤维能够有效吸收击球震动，同时通过良好的弹性产生明显的蹦床效应，让球员更轻松获得力量和深度。它采用无溶剂工艺并在法国制造，非常适合希望保护手臂、提升舒适性和降低击球难度的球员。"
  },

